*---------------------- EXTENDED HEADER FIELD
* LNMODE 2 = CN (charge note). Same chart structure as Mode 1, but the
* engine doesn't penalize early release — the player can let go of the
* key mid-hold and still get the head's verdict at the tail. Useful for
* charts authored with deliberately-brief hold cues.

#PLAYER 1
#LNTYPE 1
#LNMODE 2
#LNOBJ ZZ

